  "description": "Addict 10 is one of our most beloved road bikes simply because it's so rideable. It's light like a racing bike and redesigned to perfectly balance performance, comfort, and budget for the long haul, making Addict 10 arguably the ideal road bike. The key to its rideability lies in its geometry, which is slightly more relaxed and less compact than most racing platforms. On the ride, you'll feel more open and upright because of a longer stack and a shorter reach. Engineers also tweaked the frame's HMX carbon layup to be compliant and forgiving over small bumps and longer stretches of poor pavement.\n\nBut Addict 10 is not a slouch by any means. It'll hold speed at the front of the group, climb effortlessly in the hills, and descend on rails through the mountains. It's just that it is equally happy to slow roll with your crew on a Sunday no-drops ride as well. Nor is Addict 10 resigned to smooth, local routes should you want to push the pace outside your heat maps. Tire clearance is now 38mm, so if you're looking for a mixed-surface route to shake up your calendar, Addict 10 is ready to roll chunder better than most other so-called “all-road” bikes.\n\nAddict 10 goes where you go, how you go, and as long you go. And if you go too long, the frame-stowed Save-The-Day Kit unpacks to rescue you with a tube, tire lever, and mini-pump. Addict 10 comes equipped with SRAM's wireless Force AXS 2x groupset and fast and stable Fulcrum Wind 42 disc wheels on Schwalbe ONE tires for going long at any speed you choose.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
